<ul style=3D"line-height:150%"></ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:22px">Eyewear inn=
ovations are coming into focus</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">While other tech companies like Meta and Goog=
le are doubling down on efforts to spin out <a href=3D"https://media.hubspo=
t.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VX7B5Q3pX8y8W5mrHqc61tSZ8W3rtmkr5JPR6gMwF3Tg2=
-ZW0W7lCdLW6lZ3kvW23knj32lCpH9W6b5Ccf7XXV_FW1DHPhF6sxnk4W46vfsJ7MDMh5W1s49W=
Q2jVHVdW65y6qW2RsjmSW7s02HH9fhZ2pW51gG5L7d_zqpW30gsTK8wC97DW2R34YS3SdCTPW5Q=
