4rHgmB57gFdgW6XHvFV1dKskgf1XWNgs04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=
=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"CxFrjiKx" target=3D"_blank">smart glasses</a> =
with futuristic specs, one eyewear startup is working on improving the worl=
d=E2=80=99s oldest wearable=E2=80=99s most basic function: vision correctio=
n.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Finland-based <a href=3D"https://media.hubspo=
t.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VX7B5Q3pX8y8W5mrHqc61tSZ8W3rtmkr5JPR6gMwF3S42=
-ZW0W50kgx26lZ3m_W10B2Qv3v0_pjN2q41qKky6r_W2dNXbr31PlQHW8PK9cW7pyVkcW8zR6hS=
6cL5V5W97fNGM91WvKtW7RrQK05frTB-W1kRllQ1l0YBbW8J-pR-458L65W9k7m3n7L7QpfW3Ny=
G3M2SPg8_W8klLss7bkbT4W1RwXFq6Sp6PwW6LVvgh8S90jwW49Y_d05r_nvWW7Hy67Y4Mpycgf=
1v6s0j04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=
=3D"lGe8cKfI" target=3D"_blank">IXI</a> is developing autofocus glasses tha=
t adjust to a user=E2=80=99s vision on the fly, and it=E2=80=99s raised $40=
m in funding to bring it to market. If it succeeds, it would be the eyewear=
 industry=E2=80=99s first major innovation on vision correction in ~60 year=
s.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Similar to bifocals and varifocals, IXI=E2=80=
=99s glasses would still have separate regions for different magnification,=
 but it would provide a much more natural viewing experience with less dist=
ortion and a larger near-vision area, <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/=
e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VX7B5Q3pX8y8W5mrHqc61tSZ8W3rtmkr5JPR6gMwF3S-2-ZW0W6=
N1vHY6lZ3p6W2f4x4V3GX4CgW4ddwD03BGRYLW2Kjn7n2CmQBcW7qsWCT2997CZW1C7Fmw7_Z2K=
WW4phyg45ppnrDW2hpMGr2rLlf5W68yZSx967frdW1rqT-b1ss2vJW12788z8sP7W2W9fY4m-7f=
bgWkW3_PX2T51q98jVFvmjL3tNGm8W3Y7q643fZkfnW3ZN7hK7mHLHfW6_fF001g9K3KW2MNrN2=
266ftyW75p6Vs8ZsmXVW4NsT0b4JqPsPW2xL_Mg8KnN2GW6Yqv0D31pmmfW6GNRY_4RXgq1f4dD=
VFC04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"=
MKQz5IgG" target=3D"_blank">per</a> <span style=3D"font-style: italic;">CNN=
</span>.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">How it work=
s</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">Embedded sensors track a wearer=E2=80=99s eyes while i=
nfrared light is used to measure the reflection and predict what they=E2=80=
=99re looking at.&nbsp;<br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">That data is converted to electrical signals that info=
rm liquid crystals within the lenses to adapt to the wearer=E2=80=99s needs=
.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">What that could mean for people with trouble =
seeing far and near: no need to own multiple pairs of glasses or peer throu=
gh the bottom half of your lenses to read.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">Other compa=
nies are also working on autofocus lenses</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Japanese company <a href=3D"https://media.hub=
spot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VX7B5Q3pX8y8W5mrHqc61tSZ8W3rtmkr5JPR6gMwF3=
