could be bad for, like when driving.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">They=E2=80=99ll require further testing =E2=
=80=94 for conditions like temperature change, moisture, lighting, etc. =E2=
=80=94 before they=E2=80=99re safe to use on the road, though it does have =
a failsafe mode that would restore the glasses to their base prescription i=
n the event of a malfunction.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
